<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS3" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Sample Smart, Not Hard: Correctness-First Decoding for Better Reasoning in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.3 </span>Example of Low-Confidence Cases</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS4" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Sample Smart, Not Hard: Correctness-First Decoding for Better Reasoning in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.4 </span>Effect of Thresholds on Proposed Methods</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS5" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Sample Smart, Not Hard: Correctness-First Decoding for Better Reasoning in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.5 </span>Effect of Calibration Dataset</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS6" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Sample Smart, Not Hard: Correctness-First Decoding for Better Reasoning in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.6 </span>Failure Case Study - Poor Calibration Signals</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS7" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Sample Smart, Not Hard: Correctness-First Decoding for Better Reasoning in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.7 </span>Further Calibrated Truncation and Greedy-Threshold Results</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS8" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Sample Smart, Not Hard: Correctness-First Decoding for Better Reasoning in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.8 </span>Effectiveness at Low Temperatures</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS9" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Sample Smart, Not Hard: Correctness-First Decoding for Better Reasoning in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.9 </span>What About Creative Writing?</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS10" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Sample Smart, Not Hard: Correctness-First Decoding for Better Reasoning in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.10 </span>Example Calibration Diagrams</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
